 R←Test_Stash_012(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;dir;rc;msg;buff
⍝ Executes StashListContent without APL names
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 dir←⊃{⍺,'/',⍵}/#.Proj_1.CiderConfig.(HOME CIDER.source)

 (⊂'r←Pi' 'r←3.14')⎕NPUT dir,'/PI.aplf'
 (⊂'r←Hello' 'r←''World''')⎕NPUT dir,'/Hello.aplf'
 dir ##.APLGit2.Add''
 buff←##.APLGit2.StashPush dir
 Assert∨/'Saved working directory and index state WIP on main:'⍷∊buff
 →T.GoToTidyUp 1≠≢##.APLGit2.StashList dir

 buff←##.APLGit2.StashListContent dir 0
 →T.GoToTidyUp'APLSource/Hello.aplf' 'APLSource/PI.aplf'≢F.EnforceSlash(1+≢dir)↓¨buff[;1]
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠+/≢¨buff[;2]  ⍝ Because their is no history of them, therefore the APL names cannot be established

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 ##.APLGit2.StashClear dir
⍝Done
